  "solution": {
    "text": "Dacron is a condensation polymer. It is also known as terylene. It is a polymer obtained by condensation reaction between ethylene glycol and terephthalic acid at $420-460 \\mathrm{K}$ in the presence of zinc acetate-antimony trioxide catalyst.\r\n<img src=\"assets\\st0000_89a8257f17ea.png\">"
